  "details": "I made 2 Udon Graph scripts with 2 Persistence Keys\n\nOne is to not show the disclaimer again when rejoining the world,\n\nAnd one saves and enables the tablet if rejoined.\n\nIn one scenario, when toggling the \"don't show again\" toggle and leaving the tablet, sometimes when rejoining, either you see the disclaimer again, or the tablet gets disabled despite the toggle for it (and persistence key) being still on.\n\n+ Sometimes when despite the disclaimer being set to don't show again, and toggling the tablet, the disclaimer shows up again.\n\nIt works fine in Unity with Client Sim, but is messed up in game. Tested in Open Beta and Stable.",
